# Cloudflare Worker secrets for local development (via wrangler / @cloudflare/vite-plugin)
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in your values.
# .dev.vars is gitignored — never commit real credentials.
#
# To get Google credentials:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web application)
# 3. Add http://localhost:5173/auth/google/callback as an Authorized redirect URI
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
